  m_Text: "Drag mirrors from the mirror box to place them.\r\nYou can create lasers
    by drawing lines near the spaceship light sources.\r\nTap on a mirror to rotate
    it and change the direction of the beam.\r\nYou can drag and reposition mirrors
    but be careful you have move count.\nSome levels include colored lights and special
    button \u2013 use them wisely.\r\nWhen the light hits all the targets correctly,
    the level is complete."
